\nシャツはシンプルなタンクトップもいいですが、襟をつけたり、ワンショルダーにしたり、どこかにリボンをつけたりする等ワンポイントがあると嬉しいです。白単色無地とかは寂しいです。\n\n■イメージカラー\n姉妹ともにフレッシュグリーン。\n色コードb4e04b、a9d053、a1ca62等\n↑壁紙や衣装の一部に。\n\n■背景や壁紙等\n注力不要です。シンプルなもので大丈夫です。透過でも構いません。\n\n■データ\npsdでご納品下さい。\n\n以上、ご検討の程宜しくお願いいたします。", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1226041, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "すやzzZ", "screen_name": "sousakusuya", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1589650237974421504/_jYHVhbn.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/3228929546/1732109460/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 15, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 16}, {"id": 2986893, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "じゃのめ", "screen_name": "janome_ouka_", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1806145952891498496/u8UKilj1.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1696466431670620161/1728992704/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 7, "complete_expiration_days": 15, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 144}, {"id": 3011620, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "500円でSKEBリクエスト募集中！！", "screen_name": "aiueo77088240", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1902314331976720384/_Y92ihnD.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1510338713519214594/1742381856/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable